data: {"id": "06eecf4fd8d14644-thinking-parallel_evidence-1201", "run_id": "06eecf4fd8d14644", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我先执行首轮 Kubernetes 核心诊断工具（describe、previous logs、yaml、events），同时结合已采集的 Prometheus 和日志证据进行初步交叉验证。\n\n**计划执行：**\n1. kubectl_describe - 查看 Pod 当前状态、Last State、Exit Code\n2. kubectl_previous_logs - 获取崩溃前的容器日志\n3. kubectl_get_yaml - 验证 command/args/resources\n4. kubectl_events - 获取事件序列\n5. （Metrics 和 Tracing 已在 baseline 中采集，先分析结果）\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788801656519, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

